<title>FINLAND: Nokia wins Italian GSM expansion order.</title>
<headline>Nokia wins Italian GSM expansion order.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had won a 300 billion lira GSM network expansion order from Italian  Omnitel Pronto Italia (OPI).</p>
<p>&quot;The value of the deliveries is expected to exceed ITL 300 billion during 1996 and 1997,&quot; Nokia said.</p>
<p>It said OPI has been a Nokia customer since December 1994.</p>
